---
import ProjectLayout from "../../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro";
import Walkthrough from "../../components/Walkthrough.astro";
---
<ProjectLayout slug="csci-240">
  <Walkthrough>
      <p class="section-intro">After TAing the course, I made these video walkthroughs to help students working through the programs.</p>
      <div class="prose">
        <h3>Programs 0–3</h3>
        <p>Hello World, arithmetic, formatted output and decisions, and loops.</p>
        <div class="video">
          <iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/yA1VFemd_IQ"
                  title="CSCI 240: Programs 0-3"
                  loading="lazy"
                  allow="accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                  referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
                  allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
        <p class="muted video-link"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yA1VFemd_IQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch on YouTube</a></p>

        <h3>Programs 4–5</h3>
        <p>Loops, decision statements, symbolic constants, and random numbers.</p>
        <div class="video">
          <iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/jAN0W0p2pn8"
                  title="CSCI 240: Programs 4-5"
                  loading="lazy"
                  allow="accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                  referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
                  allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
        <p class="muted video-link"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jAN0W0p2pn8" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch on YouTube</a></p>
      </div>
  </Walkthrough>
</ProjectLayout>
